      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey i'm thinking about starting a small fintech company specifically for micro-lending in emerging markets. i've been looking at the compliance stuff and it seems like a total nightmare. can u give me a breakdown of what the biggest challenges or hurdles are gonna be for a new player trying to get started in that space?",
